          "start": 341,
          "end": 358,
          "lines": [
            "341:     validation. WPs that do not declare ownership (no ``execution_mode`` or empty",
            "342:     ``owned_files``) are skipped, mirroring finalize-tasks. Because",
            "343:     :meth:`OwnershipManifest.from_frontmatter` carries the ``scope`` field",
            "344:     through (including ``codebase-wide``), callers can exercise the full",
            "345:     overlap/exemption decision with plain ``WPMetadata`` stubs — no temp files,",
            "346:     no finalize-command mocking.",
            "347: ",
            "348:     Args:",
            "349:         frontmatters: Mapping of WP ID to its parsed ``WPMetadata``.",
            "350: ",
            "351:     Returns:",
            "352:         Mapping of WP ID to ``OwnershipManifest`` for WPs that declare ownership.",
            "353:     \"\"\"",
            "354:     manifests: dict[str, OwnershipManifest] = {}",
            "355:     for wp_id, fm in frontmatters.items():",
            "356:         if fm.execution_mode and fm.owned_files:",
            "357:             manifests[wp_id] = OwnershipManifest.from_frontmatter(fm)",
            "358:     return manifests"
          ]
