            "371: ) -> LanesManifest:",
            "372:     \"\"\"Compute execution lanes from dependency graph and ownership manifests.",
            "373: ",
            "374:     Algorithm:",
            "375:     1. Separate planning_artifact WPs from code WPs.",
            "376:     2. Union code WPs with overlapping owned_files (rule 1).",
            "377:     3. Union code WPs sharing predicted surfaces when ownership is not",
            "378:        provably disjoint (rule 2).",
            "379:     4. Preserve dependency edges as lane-level dependencies.",
            "380:     5. Build ExecutionLane per disjoint set, sorted internally by topo order.",
